  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now there is no way for you to take a picture in desktop mode without having to wait for the 5 second timer. This makes it harder to quickly take a picture of something, because you always need to wait for the 5 second timer to finish.\n# Suggestion:\nI had to ideas on how this could be solved:\n1. Add a \"Take Photo\" button to the Camera Menu\n2. Add a hotkey we can press on our mouse or keyboard to take a Photo",
